{"id":"wb-4-85","name":"怀圣寺光塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"怀圣寺","text":"怀圣寺又称光塔寺、怀圣光塔寺、龙凤寺、礼拜寺等，位于中华人民共和国广州越秀区光塔路56号，始建于唐代，是中国现存最早的清真寺，甚至是世界最早的清真寺之一。寺内怀圣塔原为教徒诵经之所，因塔位于当时的珠江边，入夜后灯光可为船只导航，故获称光塔。怀圣寺光塔为中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%80%80%E5%9C%A3%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93904745,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93904745","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0a6538151910d1f5bac580c0.jpg","title":"Huaisheng Mosque Dec 2007.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huaisheng_Mosque_Dec_2007.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/Huaisheng_Mosque_Dec_2007.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ismaila1977","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​中国广州怀圣寺。","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}